<title>FRANCE: French job creation plan ready for cabinet Aug 20.</title>
<headline>French job creation plan ready for cabinet Aug 20.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>French government plans for the creation of 350,000 jobs for young people in the public sector should be &quot;wrapped up&quot; and studied by the cabinet on August 20, government spokesman Catherine Trautmann said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;It should be wrapped up and examined on August 20,&quot; she told reporters after ministers met for preliminary talks on preparation of the 1998 budget to be presented in September.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
